    "The archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Archiv"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine did not answer as data: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engine neodpověděl daty: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The header and the text, as the editor opens them. A picture is named by its file name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hlavička a text, jak je otevírá editor. Fotka je pojmenovaná svým souborem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is made on this device and never leaves it. Put the line above into the server's ~/.ssh/authorized_keys; the forced command in front of it is what the key may run, and nothing else.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klíč vzniká na tomhle zařízení a nikdy ho neopustí. Řádek výše dej na serveru do ~/.ssh/authorized_keys; forced command před ním je vše, co klíč smí spustit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The old address keeps answering: it redirects to the new one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stará adresa dál odpovídá: přesměruje na novou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Originál"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The post is live: saving rebuilds and deploys the site.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Příspěvek je živý: uložení web sestaví a nasadí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The post keeps its text and loses only the plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Příspěvek si nechá text a přijde jen o plán."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The post, its media and its history come back where they were.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Příspěvek, jeho média i historie se vrátí, kde byly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The posts in between step back one slot each; the same times stay occupied.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Příspěvky mezi tím ustoupí každý o slot; obsazené časy zůstanou tytéž."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview is behind the queue — rebuild and deploy now": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Náhled zaostává za frontou — sestavit a nasadit teď"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The queue (%lld scheduled):": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fronta (naplánovaných: %lld):"
          }
        }
      }
    },
